<string name="help_text">Start writing directly. Tap the active pen/highlighter again for settings. Shapes are on the main toolbar. The page strip adds and switches pages; long-press a page for management. Select objects to move, resize, rotate or edit. Classroom widgets float over the board; drag their header. Seven taps on the About version text unlock calibration. Export .vura lessons before uninstalling.</string>
